  "formal": {
    "project": "research/prime_field_trace_audit_20261114/lean",
    "theorem": "PrimeFieldTraceAudit.prime_field_trace_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem prime_field_trace_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K),W.Δ≠0 → (normalized W).Δ=W.Δ ∧ Nonempty ((normalized W).Point ≃+ W.Point) ∧ ((2:K)≠0 → (3:K)≠0 → normalized W=shortModel (normalized W).a₄ (normalized W).a₆)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K),W.Δ≠0 → Nat.card W.Point=equationCount (normalized W) ∧ fieldTrace W=countedTrace (normalized W) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ countedSupersingular (normalized W))) ∧ (∀ W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F5,W.Δ≠0 → (fieldTrace W)^2≤20 ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ fieldTrace W=0) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ Nat.card W.Point=6) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W → ∀ r : ℕ,r∣Nat.card W.Point → Nat.Coprime r 5 ∧ orderOf (5:ZMod r)∣2 ∧ (2<r → orderOf (5:ZMod r)=2))) ∧ (∀ W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F7,W.Δ≠0 → (fieldTrace W)^2≤28 ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ fieldTrace W=0) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ Nat.card W.Point=8) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W → ∀ r : ℕ,r∣Nat.card W.Point → Nat.Coprime r 7 ∧ orderOf (7:ZMod r)∣2 ∧ (2<r → orderOf (7:ZMod r)=2))) ∧ (sixControl.Δ≠0 ∧ sourceSupersingular sixControl ∧ Nat.card sixControl.Point=6 ∧ addOrderOf sixPoint=6 ∧ orderOf (5:ZMod 6)=2 ∧ orderOf (5:ZMod 2)=1) ∧ (eightControl.Δ≠0 ∧ sourceSupersingular eightControl ∧ Nat.card eightControl.Point=8 ∧ addOrderOf eightPoint=8 ∧ orderOf (7:ZMod 8)=2 ∧ orderOf (7:ZMod 2)=1) ∧ (singularControl.Δ=0 ∧ Nat.card singularControl.Point=5 ∧ equationCount singularControl=6 ∧ ¬sourceSupersingular singularControl ∧ countedSupersingular singularControl) ∧ (¬∀ W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F5,Nat.card W.Point=equationCount W)",
    "decl_sha256": "59de648349f196f9d186cc1f60007ec5398d2f53840f1e81792bf2b0bdfbd169",
    "scope": "Every actual nonsingular general Weierstrass model over F5/F7: actual Hasse, exact source gcd(trace,q)!=1 iff actual trace0 iff pointcard6/8. Explicit unit-u1 short normalization in any field with2,3nonzero, unchangedDelta, credited actual additivepoint equivalence, generic finitefield actual pointcount/trace/sourcepredicate transport. Closed kernel all25/49shortcoefficientpairtables plus actual equivalence cover allgeneralmodels; no general Hasse/classification premise. Every actual source-SS countdivisor coprime with q, modularorder divides2 and exact2if r>2, includingcomposites, with no prime premise. Named actual F5y²=x³+1/P(2,2)order6 and F7y²=x³+x/P(3,3)order8; modularorders2 andmod2orders1. F5curve/modelpriorart credited. SingularF5cuspDelta0actualnonsingularpointgroupcard5/rawcount6/sourcepredicatefalse/countedpredicatetrue; directuniversalnegationafterdeletingDelta. Sourcep>=5conditionpreserved, no qualifiedsource refutation. Generalprime/extensionfieldHasse/trace-geometric-Endrankidentifications, fielddegree/fulltorsionfield/otherBKprimes/fullallkp500/original14gapsremainopen. No novelty/corpuspromotion/fullpaper-bookread/nativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
